sequenceDiagram
    actor U as User
    participant IA as ItemDetailActivity
    participant VM as ItemDetailViewModel
    participant R as PantryRepository
    participant DB as Room
    participant WA as WasteSummaryActivity

    U->>IA: taps Consumed, Wasted, Expired or Donated
    IA->>VM: recordDisposition(disposition)
    VM->>R: recordDisposition(item, disposition, callback)
    R->>DB: begin transaction
    R->>DB: insert ConsumptionHistory.fromFoodItem(...)
    R->>DB: update food item status
    R->>DB: commit
    R-->>VM: history id (background thread)
    VM-->>IA: operation result event (postValue)
    IA-->>U: toast, and the screen closes if the operation succeeded
    U->>WA: opens the waste summary
    WA->>R: getWasteStats(since)
    R-->>WA: WasteStats (counts per disposition and waste rate)
